<title>JAPAN: Amatsuji Steel -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Amatsuji Steel -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.06		vs	   10.37</p>
<p> Operating	    1.58		vs	    1.58</p>
<p> Current		1.71		vs	    1.75</p>
<p> Net		  928    million	  vs	    1.08</p>
<p> EPS		   33.30 yen	  vs	   38.84 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     28 million	  vs	  28 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Amatsuji Steel Ball Mfg Co Ltd is a top specialist manufacturer of ball bearings.</p>
